{
  "uid": "corefinance-obs",
  "title": "ASP.NET Core Observability",
  "description": "Faixa 1 responde 'estou saudavel agora?' sem rolar a tela. As faixas seguintes existem para o 'por que'. Filtros por service_name (nunca por job: o Prometheus renomeia o job do resource para exported_job no scrape).",
  "tags": [
    "corefinance",
    "observabilidade"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "env",
        "label": "Ambiente",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(target_info, deployment_environment)",
        "query": {
          "qryType": 1,
          "query": "label_values(target_info, deployment_environment)",
          "refId": "env"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {
          "text": "local",
          "value": "local"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "route",
        "label": "Rota",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count, http_route)",
        "query": {
          "qryType": 1,
          "query": "label_values(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count, http_route)",
          "refId": "route"
        },
        "regex": "/^(?!\\/health).*$/",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "intervalo",
        "label": "Janela do rate()",
        "type": "custom",
        "description": "Janela curta e reativa e ruidosa; janela longa e suave e atrasada. Nunca menor que 4x o scrape_interval (15s).",
        "query": "1m,5m,15m,1h",
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "1m",
            "value": "1m",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "5m",
            "value": "5m",
            "selected": true
          },
          {
            "text": "15m",
            "value": "15m",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "1h",
            "value": "1h",
            "selected": false
          }
        ],
        "current": {
          "text": "5m",
          "value": "5m"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "nivel",
        "label": "Nivel do log",
        "type": "custom",
        "description": "Valores normalizados pelo sink do Loki: info, nao Information.",
        "query": "trace,debug,info,warning,error,critical",
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "trace",
            "value": "trace",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "debug",
            "value": "debug",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "info",
            "value": "info",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "warning",
            "value": "warning",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "error",
            "value": "error",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "critical",
            "value": "critical",
            "selected": false
          }
        ],
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "1 — Estado agora",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requests/s",
      "description": "Trafego. O contador de requisicoes e o _count do histograma — http_requests_total nao existe no .NET 8. Rotas /health ficam de fora: o HEALTHCHECK do Docker bate a cada 30s e mascararia o trafego real.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=\"corefinance-api\", deployment_environment=\"$env\", http_route!~\"/health.*\"}[$intervalo]))",
          "legendFormat": "req/s"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "noValue": "sem trafego",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Taxa de erro",
      "description": "5xx sobre o total. O `or vector(0)` existe porque sum(rate()) de uma serie inexistente devolve vazio: sem ele o painel diria 'No data' justamente quando nao ha erro nenhum. Ja o denominador vazio (nenhum trafego) cai no noValue — 'sem trafego' e diferente de '0% de erro'.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 5,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=\"corefinance-api\", deployment_environment=\"$env\", http_route!~\"/health.*\", http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[$intervalo])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=\"corefinance-api\", deployment_environment=\"$env\", http_route!~\"/health.*\"}[$intervalo]))",
          "legendFormat": "erro"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "sem trafego",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latencia P95",
      "description": "Percentil estimado por interpolacao de bucket, nao medido: a precisao e a resolucao dos buckets naquela faixa (fase 04). O `by (le)` e obrigatorio — sem ele histogram_quantile devolve NaN sem explicar.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 10,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=\"corefinance-api\", deployment_environment=\"$env\", http_route!~\"/health.*\"}[$intervalo])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "sem trafego",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Saude",
      "description": "Gauge alimentado pelo IHealthCheckPublisher (fase 04). Nenhuma amostra antes do primeiro ciclo do publisher: 'SEM DADO' na partida e proposital — dizer 0 seria afirmar que a API esta fora do ar enquanto ela sobe. A queda leva ~80s para aparecer (publisher 15s + timeout do SQL + export 15s + scrape 15s).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 5,
        "x": 15,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "corefinance_health_status{service_name=\"corefinance-api\", deployment_environment=\"$env\"}",
          "legendFormat": "saude"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "noValue": "SEM DADO",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "HEALTHY",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "0.5": {
                  "text": "DEGRADED",
                  "color": "yellow",
                  "index": 1
                },
                "0": {
                  "text": "UNHEALTHY",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 2
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Coleta",
      "description": "Monitorar o monitor. Painel vazio nas faixas seguintes pode ser 'nenhum erro' (otimo) ou 'o Prometheus parou de coletar' (pessimo) — e este stat que separa os dois casos. up e gerado pelo proprio Prometheus a cada scrape.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "up{job=\"otel-collector\"}",
          "legendFormat": "collector"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "noValue": "SEM SCRAPE",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "COLETANDO",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "0": {
                  "text": "PARADO",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "2 — Trafego",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requisicoes por rota",
      "description": "Qual endpoint carrega o sistema. Legenda curta ({{http_route}}) de proposito: legenda de tres linhas rouba metade do grafico.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=\"corefinance-api\", deployment_environment=\"$env\", http_route!~\"/health.*\", http_route=~\"$route\"}[$intervalo]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requisicoes por status",
      "description": "Empilhado: a altura total e o trafego, a faixa vermelha e o problema. Cores fixas por valor — 2xx verde, 4xx amarelo, 5xx vermelho — para a anomalia saltar aos olhos sem ler a legenda.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (http_response_status_code) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=\"corefinance-api\", deployment_environment=\"$env\", http_route!~\"/health.*\", http_route=~\"$route\"}[$intervalo]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_response_status_code}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "200"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "204"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "semi-dark-green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "400"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "401"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "yellow"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "404"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "semi-dark-orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "500"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "3 — Latencia",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia: media vs P95 vs P99",
      "description": "O painel mais didatico do dashboard. Quando a distancia entre media e P95 se abre, existe uma cauda de requisicoes lentas que a media esconde — e a media e exatamente o numero que costuma estar no relatorio.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_sum{service_name=\"corefinance-api\", deployment_environment=\"$env\", http_route!~\"/health.*\", http_route=~\"$route\"}[$intervalo])) / sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=\"corefinance-api\", deployment_environment=\"$env\", http_route!~\"/health.*\", http_route=~\"$route\"}[$intervalo]))",
          "legendFormat": "media"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=\"corefinance-api\", deployment_environment=\"$env\", http_route!~\"/health.*\", http_route=~\"$route\"}[$intervalo])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=\"corefinance-api\", deployment_environment=\"$env\", http_route!~\"/health.*\", http_route=~\"$route\"}[$intervalo])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "media"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "p95"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
